            "title": "Rent the Runway CEO on customer loyalty, tariffs, & competition",
            "description": "<p>Rent the Runway (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RENT\">RENT</a>) stock is skyrocketing after the company hit an all-time high in active subscribers in its last quarter. Jennifer Hyman, Rent the Runway (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RENT\">RENT</a>) co-founder and CEO, joins Wealth with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/bradley-smith/\">Brad Smith</a> to discuss the company's earnings results, how customer loyalty contributed to the company's strong performance, and differentiation amid competition.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Wealth <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/wealth/\">here</a>.</p>",
